to spring in action.

00:39:58.269 --> 00:40:01.269
I still have a boyfriend.

00:40:01.269 --> 00:40:03.269
Yeah, well, man can dream, Kenny.

00:40:03.269 --> 00:40:05.269
Now you know why we call him impulse.

00:40:05.269 --> 00:40:09.869
Impulse, Cyborg, Aquaman, Green Arrow.

00:40:09.869 --> 00:40:10.869
What do you guys call your team?

00:40:10.869 --> 00:40:13.869
I don't know. I've been thinking, you know, we need something cool.

00:40:13.869 --> 00:40:15.869
We need something like, uh, like, uh...

00:40:15.869 --> 00:40:17.869
Just thinking about something with the word justice in it.

00:40:17.869 --> 00:40:20.869
After all, that's what Lex is going to get a big dose of.

00:40:20.869 --> 00:40:25.869
Victor and AC were able to hack into the 33.1 mainframe before he blew the building.

00:40:25.869 --> 00:40:27.869
That was your other mission.

00:40:27.869 --> 00:40:30.869
Haven't met the computer yet, I couldn't crack wide open.

00:40:30.869 --> 00:40:31.869
What'd you guys find out?

00:40:31.869 --> 00:40:34.869
Alex isn't satisfied playing in his own backyard anymore.

00:40:34.869 --> 00:40:39.869
Luther Corp is starting up divisions of 33.1 all across the globe.

00:40:39.869 --> 00:40:42.869
Wherever there's evidence of people with abilities,

00:40:42.869 --> 00:40:45.869
there'll be laboratories to do experiments on them.

00:40:45.869 --> 00:40:46.869
I can't let that happen.

00:40:46.869 --> 00:40:48.869
We won't.

00:40:48.869 --> 00:40:53.869
Gentlemen, our first target is a large facility on the island of Cordo-Maltese.

00:40:53.869 --> 00:40:56.869
You guys know the drill. Wheels up in 30 minutes.

00:40:56.869 --> 00:40:57.869
Fit your gear.

00:40:57.869 --> 00:41:01.860
You uh, you call me an Amigo.

00:41:01.860 --> 00:41:03.860
Yeah, you gotta come with us, man.

00:41:03.860 --> 00:41:05.860
We could use the big guns.

00:41:05.860 --> 00:41:08.550
They're right, you know.

00:41:08.550 --> 00:41:10.550
It'll be a major asset to the team.

00:41:10.550 --> 00:41:17.139
I want to be a part of this guys. I really do.

00:41:17.139 --> 00:41:18.139
But?

00:41:18.139 --> 00:41:22.019
The problem I told you about.

00:41:22.019 --> 00:41:24.019
The one that I caused, I have to take care of that first.

00:41:24.019 --> 00:41:27.659
This isn't the end of the story, Clark.

00:41:27.659 --> 00:41:40.730
This is just the beginning.

00:41:40.730 --> 00:41:41.730
Come on, boys.

00:41:41.730 --> 00:41:44.730
Let's go save the world.

00:41:44.730 --> 00:41:55.280
You know you have some pretty amazing friends, Clark Kent.

00:41:55.280 --> 00:41:56.280
Yeah.

00:41:56.280 --> 00:41:57.280
I do.

00:41:57.280 --> 00:41:59.280
Thank you.

